---
name: Receive Agentmetry events over HTTP
description: |
  Agentmetry's webhook sink posts one canonical event per request. Point
  `AGENTMETRY_AUDIT_WEBHOOK_URL` at this pipeline and keep the default
  `canonical` format, then publish the OCSF events for other pipelines.
---

accept_http "0.0.0.0:8080" {
  read_json
}
agentmetry::ocsf::normalize
publish "ocsf"
